WEBVTT

00:06:30.360 --> 00:06:32.136
"In times of dread,

00:06:32.160 --> 00:06:34.560
artists must never choose
to remain silent.

00:06:35.400 --> 00:06:37.536
There is no time for self-pity,

00:06:37.560 --> 00:06:38.920
no room for fear."

00:06:40.200 --> 00:06:42.136
Yesterday, during rehearsal,

00:06:42.160 --> 00:06:43.576
when I was told that I should

00:06:43.600 --> 00:06:46.976
"maybe cut the Black Lives Matter
portion from my talk,"

00:06:47.000 --> 00:06:48.880
I found myself fearful for a moment.

00:06:49.800 --> 00:06:52.336
Fearful that again
our stories were being denied

00:06:52.360 --> 00:06:54.480
the very stages
they deserve to be told on.

00:06:55.600 --> 00:06:58.280
And then I remembered
the words I had just spoken.

00:06:59.320 --> 00:07:01.176
"In times of dread,